op Best Sellers</a>\\n</section>\\n\\n<div class=\\\"trust-bar HDLmClassf8d8010a\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"container\\\">\\n    <span>&#10004; Serving the Yoga Community Since 1999</span>\\n    <span>&#10004; We Manufacture Our Own Gear</span>\\n    <span>&#10004; High-Quality Gear at Amazing Prices</span>\\n  </div>\\n</div>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"categories HDLmClassba2aa692\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"container\\\">\\n    <h2>Shop by Category</h2>\\n    <div class=\\\"category-links\\\">\\n      <a href=\\\"/yoga-mats\\\">Yoga Mats</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"/yoga-props\\\">Yoga Props</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"/bolsters\\\">Bolsters &amp; Cushions</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"/studio-bulk\\\">Studio &amp; Bulk Orders</a>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"featured\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"container\\\">\\n    <h2>Featured Products</h2>\\n    <p>Discover the yoga mats and props our customers love most.</p>\\n    <a href=\\\"/featured-products\\\" class=\\\"cta-btn HDLmClassccd146b\\\">Shop All Featured Products</a>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"about HDLmClass78a89014\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"container\\\">\\n    <h2>Why Shop YogaDirect?</h2>\\n    <p>Thanks to our loyal customers, YogaDirect has become one of the largest suppliers of yoga mats and props in the country. We have been faithfully supplying the Yoga community since 1999 and are confident that we can help you grow your studio, event, or personal practice with everything you need and more.</p>\\n    <p>We manufacture and source our own goods which is how we can consistently offer high-quality yoga gear at amazing prices. When you shop at YogaDirect, feel proud in knowing that you are helping to grow not only your business or personal practice but the Yoga community as a whole. From our team of Yoga lovers to you, thank you.</p>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"newsletter HDLmClassbb3b7508\\\">\\n  <h2>Stay Connected</h2>\\n  <p>Sign up for yoga tips and new product updates from our team of Yoga lovers.</p>\\n  <form action=\\\"/newsletter-signup\\\" method=\\\"post\\\">\\n    <input type=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"Enter your email address\\\" required>\\n    <button type=\\\"submit\\\">Sign Up</button>\\n  </form>\\n</section>\\n\\n<footer>\\n  <p>&copy; YogaDirect. Faithfully supplying the Yoga community since 1999.</p>\\n</footer>\\n</body>\\n</html>\", \"improvements\": [{\"What\": \"Added a prominent hero section with a clear headline and a 'Shop Best Sellers' call-to-action button\", \"Why\": \"A strong above-the-fold hero with a primary call-to-action gives visitors an immediate path to purchase, increasing click-through and conversion rates\", \"Hash\": \"HDLmClass149dc842\"}, {\"What\": \"Added a trust bar highlighting 'Serving the Yoga Community Since 1999', 'We Manufacture Our Own Gear', and 'High-Quality Gear at Amazing Prices'\", \"Why\": \"Trust signals drawn directly from the site's own messaging reduce purchase anxiety and build credibility, which lifts conversion rates\", \"Hash\": \"HDLmClassf8d8010a\"}, {\"What\": \"Restructured the brand story under a descriptive 'Why Shop YogaDirect?' heading with scannable copy\", \"Why\": \"Clear headings and scannable copy help visitors quickly absorb the value proposition, keeping them engaged and moving toward purchase\", \"Hash\": \"HDLmClass78a89014\"}, {\"What\": \"Added product category quick links for Yoga Mats, Yoga Props, Bolsters and Cushions, and Studio and Bulk Orders\", \"Why\": \"Prominent category navigation shortens the path to product pages, reducing friction and increasing add-to-cart rates\", \"Hash\": \"HDLmClassba2aa692\"}, {\"What\": \"Added an email newsletter signup section offering yoga tips and new product updates\", \"Why\": \"Capturing visitor emails enables follow-up marketing that recovers otherwise lost visitors and drives repeat purchases and revenue\", \"Hash\": \"HDLmClassbb3b7508\"}, {\"What\": \"Added a 'Shop 